# caption: Execute checked managed addition through the scalar foreign-call bridge.

REQUIRE two language values; supported exact-integer conversion policy
ENSURE managed sum or a language error with no uninitialized result read
check both values' kinds and signed 32-bit ranges
prepare address-stable plan for two int32 arguments and one pointer
create typed slots and local result storage
invoke the known native checked-add target through libffi
IF bridge failure or native status is not success THEN
  translate status; do not read the arithmetic output
ELSE
  convert initialized arithmetic output to a language integer
END IF

